# ============================================
# DEPLOYMENT NOTES
# ============================================
#
# FOR VERCEL:
# - Add these variables via Dashboard or CLI
# - Do NOT include PORT variable
# - Vercel uses serverless functions
#
# FOR RENDER.COM:
# - Add all variables above
# - MUST include: PORT=10000
# - Render uses traditional Node.js server
#
# FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# - Copy this to server/.env
# - Change CORS_ORIGIN to http://localhost:5173
# - Change NODE_ENV to development
#
# ============================================

